tps://api.github.com/users/damienmg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-11-30T08:11:03Z","updated_at":"2015-11-30T08:11:03Z","body":"Ok here what I think is happening (I have no proof though): zipper creates directory with a wrong umode when sandboxing. Zipper does create directory with a default mode if the entry is not specified, specifying the directory entry force to have them with the good mode in the zip file. This would be consistent with sandboxing because the default rights are a bit different in sandboxed mode.\n\nCan you try `|| (ls -R; exit 1)` in the genrule to see the output tree in the sandbox?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/160551369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"damienmg","id":3721087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjEwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3721087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg","html_url":"https://github.com/damienmg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/161138780","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/630#issuecomment-161138780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/630","id":161138780,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MTEzODc4MA==","user":{"login":"ekuefler","id":666477,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/666477?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler","html_url":"https://github.com/ekuefler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-12-02T00:16:14Z","updated_at":"2015-12-02T00:16:14Z","body":"I think you've got it -\n\n`ls -lR` with `-type f`:\n\n```\n.:\ntotal 4\ndrw-r--r-- 2 nobody nogroup 4096 Dec  2 00:13 WEB-INF\n\n./WEB-INF:\ntotal 0\n```\n\n`ls -lR` without `-type f`:\n\n```\n.:\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 nobody nogroup 4096 Dec  2 00:13 WEB-INF\n\n./WEB-INF:\ntotal 16\n-rw-r--r-- 1 nobody nogroup  432 Dec  2 00:13 appengine-web.xml\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 nobody nogroup 4096 Dec  2 00:13 lib\n-rw-r--r-- 1 nobody nogroup   14 Dec  2 00:13 logging.properties\n-rw-r--r-- 1 nobody nogroup 2110 Dec  2 00:13 web.xml\n```\n\nSo in the happy case the directory is created with permissions 755, but when it auto-creates it it does so with permissions 644 in the sandbox, which would explain the later error.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/161138780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ekuefler","id":666477,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/666477?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler","html_url":"https://github.com/ekuefler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ekuefler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":479922572,"node_id":"MDE3OlJlbmFtZWRUaXRsZUV2ZW50NDc5OTIyNTcy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/479922572","actor":{"login":"damienmg","id":3721087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjEwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3721087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg","html_url":"https://github.com/damienmg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/subscriptions","orga